        "title": "Overview",
        "content": "# Module 23: TURNING 18 LEGAL DOCS, IPOs AUR CYBER INSURANCE\n\nAiyyo dost! Welcome to **Module 23 of Rupaiya 101**! Agar aap abhi-abhi 18 saal ke hue ho ya agle kuch mahino mein 18 saal ke hone wale ho, toh sabse pehle: **Happy Official Legal & Financial Adulthood!** 🎂🎉\n\nIndia mein 18th birthday ek aisi magical boundary line hai jo aapki life ko 180 degrees badal deti hai. 17 saal 364 din tak, aap kanoon aur banking system ki nazar mein ek \"Minor\" the. AAP ke saare legal contracts, bank accounts, investments, aur major identity documents aapke parents ya legal guardians ke signatures aur permission par chalte the. Lekin jaise hi 18th birthday ka midnight clock strike karta hai, aap India ke constitution aur legal system ke mutabiq ek **Independent Legal Entity (Major Adult)** ban jaate ho.",
