        "content": "Major hone ke saath ek taraf jahan exciting opportunities khulti hain — aap apna independent bank account chala sakte ho, stock market IPOs mein apply karke short-term listing gains aur long-term wealth bana sakte ho, apna PAN card, Voter ID, Driving License, aur Passport banwa sakte ho... Wahan doosri taraf ek bohot badi dark reality bhi shuru hoti hai: **Aap ab Cyber Criminals, Financial Fraudsters, aur Identity Thieves ke prime target ban jaate ho!**\n\nJab aap minor hote ho, toh law aapko extra protection deta hai. Lekin adult hote hi legal accountability aapke shoulders par aati hai. Agar aapne kisi fraudster ko bank detail di, agar aapke PAN Card par kisi fraudster ne fake instant loan app se ₹1 Lakh ka loan utha liya, ya aapki biometrics leak ho gayi, toh bank aur police aapko ek responsible adult maantay hain.\n\nIs Module 23 mein hum koi dry, boring government gazette ya college textbook ki tarah law nahi padhenge. Hum ek friendly senior ki tarah zameen par khade hokar step-by-step operational roadmap dekhenge. Hum har portal ka actual navigation link, exact step-by-step procedures, mathematical allotment formulas, cyber defense strategies, aur real Indian college students — **Rahul, Sneha, Amit, Meera, Priya, Rohan, Kunal, aur Aman** ki real-life kahaniyon se seekhenge!",
